I am using the exact same distro.  The only problem I have had with Moz
1.1 is when permissions are messed up.  Make sure you have full
read/write access to your .mozilla foler in your home directory.
Then go to bugzilla and see if your problem is a known issue for Moz
1.1.  If it isn't, report the bug with as much info as you can.

I have found that the best workaround for mozilla is to use galeon
instead.  In fact, you should go to http://galeon.sourceforge.net and
download the latest rpm for it.  Not only is it more customizable, but
it's more stable.


